---
import { twoSiteStructureFactor } from '../../../data/part04/ch12TeachingModels.mjs';

const defaultOffset = 0.5;
const orders = Array.from({ length: 7 }, (_, order) => order);
const bars = orders.map((order) => ({
  order,
  intensity: twoSiteStructureFactor({ order, fractionalOffset: defaultOffset }).intensity,
}));
---

<figure class="chapter-visual structure-factor" data-structure-factor>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：两原子基元的结构因子与消光</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: structure factor and extinction for a two-site basis</span>
  </figcaption>

  <label class="structure-factor__control">
    <span>第二个原子的分数坐标 τ/a | Fractional offset τ/a</span>
    <input aria-label="Second site fractional offset" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value={defaultOffset} data-sf-offset />
    <output data-sf-offset-output>{defaultOffset.toFixed(2)}</output>
  </label>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="sf-title sf-desc">
    <title id="sf-title">Structure-factor intensities for reciprocal orders zero through six</title>
    <desc id="sf-desc">Bar chart of the squared magnitude of one plus a phase factor from a second basis site.</desc>
    <line x1="50" y1="245" x2="560" y2="245" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="50" y1="35" x2="50" y2="245" class="plot-axis" />
    {bars.map(({ order, intensity }) => (
      <g data-sf-bar-group data-order={order}>
        <rect
          x={75 + order * 68}
          y={245 - intensity * 45}
          width="38"
          height={intensity * 45}
          class="structure-factor__bar"
          data-sf-bar
        />
        <text x={94 + order * 68} y="268" text-anchor="middle">{order}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="560" y="290" text-anchor="end">reciprocal order m</text>
    <text x="16" y="40">|Sₘ|²</text>
    <text x="42" y="249" text-anchor="end">0</text>
    <text x="42" y="69" text-anchor="end">4</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>奇数级平均强度 | mean odd-order intensity:</span>
    <strong data-sf-odd>0.000</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>一维晶格中两个相同散射中心位于 <code>0</code> 和 <code>τ</code>，<code>S_m=1+exp(i2πmτ/a)</code>，柱高为 <code>|S_m|²</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> two identical scattering centers lie at <code>0</code> and <code>τ</code> in a one-dimensional lattice, <code>S_m=1+exp(i2πmτ/a)</code>, and each bar shows <code>|S_m|²</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong><code>τ/a=0</code> 时所有级次强度为 4；<code>τ/a=1/2</code> 时奇数 <code>m</code> 完全消光，偶数 <code>m</code> 强度为 4。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> at <code>τ/a=0</code> every order has intensity 4; at <code>τ/a=1/2</code> odd orders vanish and even orders retain intensity 4.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>这里的中心具有相同 form factor，且只展示几何相位。真实多元素晶体还包含物种依赖的 form factors、三维对称性和非局域项。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the two centers share the same form factor and only geometric phases are shown. A real multicomponent crystal also has species-dependent form factors, three-dimensional symmetry, and possibly nonlocal terms.</p>
  </div>
  <noscript><p>JavaScript 已关闭：静态柱图对应半格矢基元，奇数级消光仍可直接读取。</p></noscript>
</figure>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-structure-factor]').forEach((root) => {
    const input = root.querySelector('[data-sf-offset]');
    const output = root.querySelector('[data-sf-offset-output]');
    const oddOutput = root.querySelector('[data-sf-odd]');
    const groups = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll('[data-sf-bar-group]'));
    if (!(input instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;

    const update = () => {
      const offset = Number(input.value);
      let oddSum = 0;
      let oddCount = 0;
      groups.forEach((group) => {
        const order = Number(group.getAttribute('data-order'));
        const intensity = 2 + 2 * Math.cos(2 * Math.PI * order * offset);
        const bar = group.querySelector('[data-sf-bar]');
        if (bar instanceof SVGRectElement) {
          bar.setAttribute('y', String(245 - Math.max(0, intensity) * 45));
          bar.setAttribute('height', String(Math.max(0, intensity) * 45));
        }
        if (order % 2 === 1) {
          oddSum += intensity;
          oddCount += 1;
        }
      });
      if (output instanceof HTMLOutputElement) output.value = offset.toFixed(2);
      if (oddOutput instanceof HTMLElement) oddOutput.textContent = (oddSum / oddCount).toFixed(3);
    };

    input.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .structure-factor__control { display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .structure-factor input, .structure-factor svg { width: 100%; }
  .structure-factor svg text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 13px; }
  .structure-factor__bar { fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high); opacity: 0.82; }
</style>
